    <item>
      <title>From: A.C. Holloway, To: Jeanette Knox Chandler</title>
      <link>//localhost:1313/1927/12/23/753/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 23 Dec 1927 23:51:42 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>//localhost:1313/1927/12/23/753/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140519_17524201_0289.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140519_17524201_0289&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140519_17524201_0289.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/1927/12/postcard-2014-20140528_17461973_0359.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140528_17461973_0359&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/1927/12/postcard-2014-20140528_17461973_0359.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From: A.C. Holloway, To: Jeanette Knox Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Pearl, Illinois on December 23, 1927&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mailing Address:&lt;br&gt;
Mrs. E. H. Chandler&lt;br&gt;
2018 Newland Ave.&lt;br&gt;
Chicago, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Return Address:&lt;br&gt;
After 5 days return to&lt;br&gt;
A.C.. Holloway&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;12/23/27&lt;br&gt;
Mrs. E.H. Chandler,&lt;br&gt;
I got your letter and sent your order to Anna yesterday. I will send you a bill of it. But you just wait until you come home to pay.&lt;br&gt;
Thanking you,&lt;br&gt;
A.C. Holloway&lt;/p&gt;</description>
